Package: servmanager
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SahilSidhu7 <sahilsidhu3127@gmail.com>
Depends: python3, python3-pip, python3-venv, nodejs, npm, systemd
Description: ServManager Dashboard
 Self-hosted server administration dashboard and mobile remote.
 Monitor live resources, write and run shell scripts on demand or
 on a schedule, open SSH terminals in the browser, and control it
 all from a PIN-protected mobile remote. Single port, zero database.
